# GET /WebUntis/api/rest/view/v1/timetable/entries

```
GET https://cjd-koewi.webuntis.com/WebUntis/api/rest/view/v1/timetable/entries?start=2026-08-17&end=2026-08-23&format=8&resourceType=CLASS&resources=1664&periodTypes=NORMAL_TEACHING_PERIOD%2CADDITIONAL_PERIOD%2CSTAND_BY_PERIOD%2COFFICE_HOUR%2CEXAM%2CBREAK_SUPERVISION%2CEVENT%2CMEETING%2CPLATFORM_CALENDAR_EVENT%2CPERSONAL_CALENDAR_EVENT&layout=PRIORITY&school=cjd-koewi
```

**Auth:** Bearer token required.

The main timetable data endpoint — supersedes `getTimetable2017`'s flat `periods` array with a pre-laid-out
grid model (`gridEntries[].position1`..`position7`, `layoutGroup`/`layoutStartPosition`/`layoutWidth` for
overlapping-period rendering, `icons` for homework/notes badges). See `../spec/openapi.yaml`'s `GridEntry`
schema and `../spec/NOTES.md` §4 for the full field-by-field breakdown.

